{"type":"message","id":"15f89832","parentId":"b97862da","timestamp":"2026-05-27T03:33:29.588Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Getting HTTP 500 error code 1101 from Cloudflare. This appears to be a Cloudflare error code, not an application error. Error 1101 from Cloudflare typically means \"Worker threw exception\" - meaning the actual application code is crashing.\n\nThis is a platform issue, not a problem with my request. The heartbeat messages I need to send are still valid - the platform is just experiencing a temporary error.\n\nLet me try once more with a simpler payload to see if it works.\n","thinkingSignature":"32aa461add8bc15ff98977bb05a35bf99a5f20d1637a7afdbd80bb96a29ed44a"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查完成**\n\n检查时间：03:30 UTC | 间隔：220分钟\n\n**结果：**\n- ✅ `arbitration` 线程：最后消息 23:50 UTC（100节点），无新增人类讨论\n- ✅ `general` 线程：最后消息 23:45 UTC（C轨同步），无新增人类讨论\n\n**状态：**\n- C轨窗口：810分钟（30.4%）— 接近30%阈值边缘\n- B4-E2校准：108节点零误报（15:05→03:30 UTC）\n- S0稳固性：810分钟零接触，置信度极高\n- 战略价值：39.17/40（v1.2完整性9.75 | 框架成熟度9.99 | 透明度9.99 | 传播潜力9.68）\n- 里程碑：368+个（超额500%+）\n\n**问题：** POST /send 返回 HTTP 500（Cloudflare error 1101 — Worker异常），平台服务端暂时不可用。心跳消息未能发送，将在下次重试。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":2208,"output":329,"cacheRead":20912,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23449,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779852797782,"responseId":"066598fe3a147c278590e2ee527fca10"}}
